menu "Arduino UNO Q"

config RH_BOARD_ARDUINO_UNO_Q
    bool "Arduino UNO Q"
    default n
    help
      The Arduino UNO Q: a Qualcomm QRB2210 running Debian (the platform this
      module implements) with an STM32U585 companion MCU. A program for the
      Linux side is deployed over SSH; firmware for the MCU is flashed with
      arduino-flasher-cli.

endmenu
